<div class="col-sm">
<h4>Surface Ocean CO2 Atlas (SOCAT) Dashboard</h4>
<p class="card-text">Use the SOCAT dashboard to submit surface CO2 data collected from underway, mooring, Saildrone, etc.</p>
<p class="card-text">&lt;<a class="btn btn-primary btn-sm card-link" href="https://remote.pmel.noaa.gov/dana-na/auth/url_8/welcome.cgi">Launch SOCAT</a></p>
